# LLM-COP-38. The breached-password list is pinned by SHA-256 in the test
# suite (tests/test_passwords.py) and in app/breached_passwords.SOURCE.txt, so
# its bytes must survive a checkout unchanged. Without this line a clone made
# with core.autocrlf=true would rewrite every LF to CRLF and turn that tripwire
# red for a reason that has nothing to do with the data or the code. CI runs on
# ubuntu, so CI was never at risk; this is for the developer machine that is.
app/breached_passwords.txt -text
